    "title": "🧪 Practice 3 — 30.0%|||🧪 Practice 3 — 30.0%",
    "slug": "ano301-flm-thi-4",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Practice 3 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANO301 · Assessment 4/4</span>\n<h2>Practice 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13439 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANO301 · Đầu điểm 4/4</span>\n<h2>Practice 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13439 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">3 Week</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3,CLO4,CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Students will build a runnable 2D game in Unity using assets from Assignment 2 and the approved GDD, integrating complete game flow and UI flow, and ensuring a fully playable level from start to finish. Code may be provided, downloaded, or self-written or modified, and the project must also include professional advertising and showcase materials to present the game proposal effectively.<br>The final submission is playable build, advertising or showcase content.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Learn to integrate 2D assets into Unity, manage animation, VFX, UI, and scene flow, and apply or adapt code at a functional level to connect visuals with gameplay.<br>Gain experience in presenting and promoting their project professionally through advertising and showcase outputs.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Group assignment of 3–4 students, carried out in class and at home over 2 weeks.<br>Teams will present progress in stages, get feedback from the instructor, and update their work accordingly.<br>During review sessions, students must present how AI was used, discuss AI-generated issues with the instructor, and justify their design choices before the final presentation.<br>Students must document updates and manage different report versions as part of the submission.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Based on the studied LO, lecturer will instruct students how to complete their game project.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
